 "description": "The 12 N2 RAD-51 gonads of 2025-11-05 (DAPI, SYP, RAD-51; no heat shock and heat shock; hermaphrodites and males) with their Imaris annotations, split into train, val and test before any benchmark result was computed. Roles are fixed; re-running scripts/make_rad51_split.py only refreshes the file facts.",
 "frame": {
  "rule": "Imaris coordinates are voxel centres scaled by Imaris's rounded voxel size (0.108 um in xy; the .nd2 says 0.108333). Convert an Imaris coordinate to a voxel index with Imaris's own voxel size, floor((coord - ExtMin) / imaris_voxel), and place it in the pipeline frame as index times the .nd2 voxel size. Matching in raw micrometres drifts by almost a micrometre across the 2600-pixel field."
 },
